  "description": "R-PAR-1 PAR-ORDER, SQL-REL: Do the snapshot, dynaset and forward-only recordsets of the same statement give the same row order and the same tied rows: TOP 20 ins ORDER BY k, ins WHERE k = 2, ins unordered, and GROUP BY k with Count, on OT3 (one GetRows(300) per statement and type)? Runs on a fresh copy of r-par-1-order opened read-only through DAO OpenDatabase in one process and one STA; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, and every call's result, HRESULT and DBEngine.Errors are captured.",
